<view class="page-shell journey-page"><view class="eyebrow">SEVEN DAYS · 七日星光</view><view class="journey-title">用七天，给自己留一条线索</view><view wx:if="{{!journey.started}}" class="journey-intro"><view class="journey-symbol">✦</view><view class="journey-lead">每天只做一件小事，慢慢把注意力带回自己。</view><view class="journey-copy">不需要先选星座，也没有断签惩罚。准备好时，就从今天开始。</view><button class="primary-button journey-start" style="width:100%" bindtap="start">开始七日旅程 <text>→</text></button></view><block wx:elif="{{journey.completed}}"><view class="journey-complete-kicker">SEVEN DAYS COMPLETE</view><reading-card card="{{journey.summary}}" show-advice="{{true}}"/><button class="primary-button journey-action" style="width:100%" bindtap="openSummary">查看七日总结 · 留成海报</button><button class="ghost-button journey-action" style="width:100%" bindtap="start">开始下一轮</button></block><block wx:else><view class="journey-headline"><view><view class="journey-kicker">正在进行</view><view class="journey-progress">第 {{journey.currentDay}} / 7 天</view></view><text>{{journey.completedDays}} 天已完成</text></view><view class="journey-nodes"><view wx:for="{{journey.days}}" wx:key="day" class="journey-node journey-node-{{item.status}}"><view class="journey-node-dot">{{item.status === 'done' ? '✓' : item.day}}</view><view>{{item.title}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{journey.card}}" class="journey-card" bindtap="openDetail" role="button"><view class="journey-card-index">DAY 0{{journey.card.day}}</view><view class="journey-card-title">{{journey.card.title}}</view><view class="journey-card-text">{{journey.card.text}}</view><action-followup card="{{journey.card}}" compact="{{true}}" bind:statuschange="actionChanged"/></view><view wx:else class="journey-wait"><view class="journey-wait-symbol">✦</view><view>今天的这一小步已经收下</view><view class="journey-wait-copy">明天再回来，继续下一张星光。</view></view><view class="journey-links"><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="openWeekly">看看本周星光</button><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="openHome">回到今日卡</button></view></block><view class="journey-footnote">旅程记录只保存在当前设备 · 不代表运势或评判</view></view>
